WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:15.382
Where are we?

2
00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:20.844
Danny: I think I think we're in the same place that we were before.

3
00:00:20.864 --> 00:00:23.325
Brad: What just happened?

4
00:00:23.345 --> 00:00:25.986
Danny: It was like an explosion.

5
00:00:26.006 --> 00:00:30.008
Brad: Where did Chuck and Dave go?

6
00:00:32.704 --> 00:00:34.466
Danny: They're they're gone!

7
00:00:34.486 --> 00:00:38.649
Brad: Do you think we shrunk them?

8
00:00:38.669 --> 00:00:40.330
Danny: Ha-ha!

9
00:00:40.451 --> 00:00:41.191
We must have.

10
00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:41.932
It worked!

11
00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:42.732
It worked!

12
00:00:43.393 --> 00:00:47.056
Brad: I don't see them.

13
00:00:47.076 --> 00:00:49.558
Danny: Who cares where they are?

14
00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:51.840
This is the best day ever!

15
00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:53.541
Bye-bye, bullies!

16
00:00:54.782 --> 00:01:01.428
Brad: I don't see footprints, so they didn't walk away.

17
00:01:04.556 --> 00:01:06.017
Danny: Brad, we shrunk them!

18
00:01:06.878 --> 00:01:08.159
That's what we wanted to do.

19
00:01:08.179 --> 00:01:11.281
Danny: You should be happy, not worried.

20
00:01:11.301 --> 00:01:14.383
Brad: I know, I know.

21
00:01:14.403 --> 00:01:16.525
But Danny: But what?

22
00:01:16.545 --> 00:01:23.810
Brad: Well, if we did shrink them, and they're really tiny─ Danny: We'll never see them again!

23
00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:26.532
Brad: They're in danger, Danny.

24
00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:31.316
Danny: I don't think I'm hearing you right.

25
00:01:32.172 --> 00:01:34.693
Danny: Why are you worried about those bullies?

26
00:01:34.713 --> 00:01:38.035
Danny: Maybe they're small and totally safe.

27
00:01:38.175 --> 00:01:40.936
Brad: Well that could be possible.

28
00:01:40.956 --> 00:01:42.957
Danny: Our plan worked.

29
00:01:43.657 --> 00:01:44.418
Now we can go.

30
00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:48.540
Brad: But if they are in trouble, we should help them, Danny.

31
00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:49.860
Danny: Ugh!

32
00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.081
You're just as bad as Tina!

33
00:01:52.101 --> 00:01:56.063
Brad: Well, Tina and you are the ones who said it to me first.

34
00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:57.884
Danny: What do you mean?

35
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:01.700
Tina: Oh, Brad!

36
00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:03.601
We need to help the giants.

37
00:02:04.341 --> 00:02:06.902
Tina: Imagine living in a world without color.

38
00:02:06.922 --> 00:02:09.623
Brad: Sure, that would be terrible.

39
00:02:10.423 --> 00:02:12.063
But why is it my problem?

40
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:15.504
Danny: Because you can help, that's why.

41
00:02:15.524 --> 00:02:21.386
Brad: We should help Chuck and Dave for the same reason [n3@that we helped the giants.

42
00:02:22.146 --> 00:02:25.247
Brad: It's the reason you help anyone: because you can!

43
00:02:25.287 --> 00:02:26.827
Danny: Bleh!

44
00:02:27.308 --> 00:02:28.568
You sound like a teacher.

45
00:02:29.728 --> 00:02:32.509
Brad: Let's find them, at least, and see if they are okay.

46
00:02:32.529 --> 00:02:35.990
Danny: Find them, hmm.

47
00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:38.771
He-he. I'd like to see that.

48
00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:40.111
Brad: See what?

49
00:02:40.131 --> 00:02:41.231
Danny: What?

50
00:02:41.511 --> 00:02:42.191
Oh, nothing.

51
00:02:42.372 --> 00:02:45.852
Brad: Anyway, let's start looking.

52
00:02:46.553 --> 00:02:48.513
Danny: They could be anywhere.

53
00:02:48.673 --> 00:02:51.954
Brad: You go over there, and I'll start here.

54
00:02:51.974 --> 00:02:53.375
Danny: Fine.

55
00:02:53.775 --> 00:02:58.116
Brad: Walk carefully!

56
00:02:59.116 --> 00:02:59.878
Danny: I will.

57
00:03:04.713 --> 00:03:05.355
Oh no!
